1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,100
Can you travel at the speed of light? Not quite.

2
00:00:03,650 --> 00:00:09,600
Light covers almost 300,000 km a second. Nearing that speed takes ever more energy. Only light itself reaches it.

3
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:15,600
Go very fast and, for you, time runs slower, so a long trip feels shorter.

4
00:00:16,150 --> 00:00:19,600
Follow for more.

